*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
# The dedup cache is pipeline STATE, not scratch. Phase 1 ran from
# cron_runner.sh on a persistent host, so ignoring everything here was correct.
# The pipeline now runs in GitHub Actions: every run starts from a fresh
# actions/checkout, so an ignored cache file is an ABSENT cache file, load_seen()
# returns {} and the 60-day dedup has never once fired in CI. Measured
# 2026-09-16 over reports/physics-gen-daily/: 273 cross-day re-emissions of the
# same arXiv id, 272 of them (99.6%) inside the window the cache was supposed to
# cover. The repo is the only durable store this deployment has — track it.
!seen_arxiv_ids.json
